OL,3,GNEWSAHearings begin over future of #1bn
OL,4,Asolar farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FPublic hearings over the future of a
OL,7,Fhuge proposed solar farm are due to get
OL,8,Funder way.
OL,10,FDeveloper Island Green Power (IGP) has
OL,11,Fsaid the East Pye scheme will be on
OL,12,Fland near Long Stratton, in Norfolk,
OL,13,Fand will generate enough power for
OL,14,F115,000 homes.
OL,16,FSix months of hearings, starting on
OL,17,FTuesday at Dunston Hall, near Norwich,
OL,18,Fwill examine the scheme spanning 2,700
OL,19,Facres (1,090 hectares).
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
