OL,4,Asolar farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FOnce this examination process has
OL,7,Fended, inspector David Cliff will have
OL,8,Fthree months to submit a recommendation
OL,9,Fto the energy secretary, Miatta
OL,10,FFahnbulleh, who will have a further
OL,11,Fthree months to make a decision.
